y"],["ARC or PLC in Bureau County","/arc-plc/illinois/bureau-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on Bureau County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 39% of normal in August to September and 42% in September to October. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 171% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 25361 had its driest year in 2005 at 57% of normal.</p>"}
